OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will get off to a
OL,6,Fdry albeit rather cloudy start. Skies
OL,7,Fwill soon brighten from the south
OL,8,Fallowing very warm sunshine to
OL,9,Fdevelop. Cloud beginning to increase
OL,10,Fagain later, with the chance of some
OL,11,Fevening showers. Humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud will thicken from the
OL,14,Fsouth during the evening with further
OL,15,Fshowers breaking out overnight, some
OL,16,Fperhaps heavy. Later though it should
OL,17,Fdry out with the cloud breaking up.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
