OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday morning looks
OL,6,Fgenerally fine with some very warm
OL,7,Fspells of sunshine developing.
OL,8,FHowever, as cloud increases heading
OL,9,Finto the afternoon one or two showers
OL,10,Fare possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday will be less warm and breezy
OL,14,Fwith sunshine and scattered showers.
OL,15,FBecoming drier and less breezy to end
OL,16,Fthe week with some more prolonged
OL,17,Fspells of sunshine, though fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
